---
// Guess now, check later, apologise if needed. The seat example is illustrative.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 292" role="img" aria-label="Four steps: an order arrives, the system accepts it from local memory, the hard limit is checked later and finds more orders than seats, and an apology such as a refund, voucher or upgrade repairs it.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Guess now, check later, apologise if needed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đoán trước, kiểm tra sau, xin lỗi nếu cần</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="110" cy="68" r="11" class="unb-step" /><text x="110" y="72.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-step-n">1</text>
      <circle cx="335" cy="68" r="11" class="unb-step" /><text x="335" y="72.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-step-n">2</text>
      <circle cx="560" cy="68" r="11" class="unb-step is-hot" /><text x="560" y="72.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-step-n is-hot">3</text>
      <circle cx="785" cy="68" r="11" class="unb-step is-good" /><text x="785" y="72.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-step-n is-good">4</text>
      <rect x="20" y="92" width="180" height="116" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={110} y={120} size={28} />
      <text x="110" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Order arrives</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có đơn mới</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>customer wants a seat</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khách muốn đặt ghế</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>on a nearly full flight</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chuyến bay gần đầy</tspan></text>
      <rect x="245" y="92" width="180" height="116" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={335} y={120} size={28} />
      <text x="335" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Accept now (guess)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhận ngay (đoán)</tspan></text>
      <text x="335" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>local memory says</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bộ nhớ cục bộ báo</tspan></text>
      <text x="335" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>one seat is left</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>còn một ghế</tspan></text>
      <rect x="470" y="92" width="180" height="116" rx="4" class="unb-box is-hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={560} y={120} size={28} />
      <text x="560" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Check later</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kiểm tra sau</tspan></text>
      <text x="560" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>more orders than</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số đơn nhiều hơn</tspan></text>
      <text x="560" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>real seats</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số ghế thật</tspan></text>
      <rect x="695" y="92" width="180" height="116" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="mail" x={785} y={120} size={28} />
      <text x="785" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Apologise</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xin lỗi, bù trừ</tspan></text>
      <text x="785" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>refund, voucher,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hoàn tiền, voucher,</tspan></text>
      <text x="785" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>or an upgrade</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hoặc nâng hạng</tspan></text>
      <path d="M200,150 L238,150" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="237,145.5 237,154.5 245,150" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M425,150 L463,150" class="unb-solid is-hot" /><polygon points="462,145.5 462,154.5 470,150" class="unb-head is-hot" />
      <path d="M650,150 L688,150" class="unb-solid is-good" /><polygon points="687,145.5 687,154.5 695,150" class="unb-head is-good" />
      <text x="450" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Airlines overbook seats and hotels overbook rooms in just this way.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hãng bay bán vượt số ghế và khách sạn bán vượt số phòng đúng theo cách này.</tspan></text>
      <text x="450" y="268" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-note is-good"><tspan data-lang-en>No global lock was needed, and the customer is still made whole.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không cần khoá toàn cục mà khách vẫn được bù đắp thoả đáng.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A compensating action replaces a lock: accept the order optimistically, then repair the rare case where demand beats supply.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một hành động bù trừ thay cho khoá: nhận đơn một cách lạc quan, rồi sửa lại trường hợp hiếm khi nhu cầu vượt nguồn cung.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
